stem information\n\nN/A\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe implementation of `Vector4` division uses `*this * (1 / s)` instead of direct division, which leads to precision loss and inconsistent results with the other vector types, the potential performance benefits of doing division once and then doing multiplication should probably be negligible on modern machines, but at minimum the loss of precision compared with the other types is probably more serious\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCompare the printout of the following:\n```gdscript\n# Prints (6.89655160903931, 6.89655160903931, 6.89655160903931)\nprint(\"%.14v\" % [Vector3(20, 20, 20) / 2.9])\n# Prints (6.89655160903931, 6.89655160903931, 6.89655160903931)\nprint(\"%.14v\" % [Vector3(20 / 2.9, 20 / 2.9, 20 / 2.9)])\n# Prints (6.89655113220215, 6.89655113220215, 6.89655113220215, 6.89655113220215)\nprint(\"%.14v\" % [Vector4(20, 20, 20, 20) / 2.9])\n# Prints (6.89655160903931, 6.89655160903931, 6.89655160903931, 6.89655160903931)\nprint(\"%.14v\" % [Vector4(20 / 2.9, 20 / 2.9, 20 / 2.9, 20 / 2.9)])\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type"